{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "551be353-699e-80f7-8324-e030148ae506",
  "created_at": "2025-12-31T10:33:11-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Zoning and Inspections",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Aisha Tran",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Anita Chaudhry",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T10:30:16-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zoning and Inspections, this is Anita. Happy almost New Year. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T10:30:21-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, good morning. It's not almost, it's tomorrow, dear, but happy New Year to you too. I'm calling about a fence. I got a quote from a fence company and before I sign anything I want to know where I stand."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T10:30:34-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, I can help with that. Can I get your name and the address where the fence would go?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T10:30:41-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Aisha Tran. It's 8 Eustis Avenue, up on the Hill."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T10:30:45-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Ms. Tran. And what kind of fence are you planning?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T10:30:50-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Composite. Six feet tall. The man wrote it down as a privacy fence, but I just call it six feet."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T10:30:57-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, composite, six feet. And is this along the side or back of the property, or the front?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T10:31:03-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, the back and one side. Why, does that matter? I thought you just either need a permit or you don't."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T10:31:10-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So that's my question, really. Does a fence need a permit? The salesman said, oh, we take care of everything, but he didn't say what everything was."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T10:31:19-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A fence that tall generally does need a permit, yes. And where it sits can change what's required, especially in a historic neighborhood like yours, so I'd want to confirm the details for your lot."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T10:31:30-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hm. So who applies, him or me? I'm the owner. Is it my name on it or his?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T10:31:36-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Either can happen. Contractors often file on the owner's behalf, but the owner is responsible for the property. So you'd want it in writing in your contract that they're pulling the permit."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T10:31:46-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "In writing. All right. I'll make him put that in. And you said, what, six feet is over the limit? I didn't catch that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T10:31:54-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I didn't say it's over a limit, ma'am. I said a fence that height generally requires a permit. I'd rather not quote you a number from memory, so I can have someone confirm the height rules for your zone."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T10:32:06-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, that's not what I heard, but all right. Now the fee. What does the permit cost? He has a line on the quote that says permit, with a price, and I don't know if that's his price or yours."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T10:32:19-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The city charges its own fee for the permit, and a contractor may add their handling on top. I don't have the exact amount in front of me. The office can tell you when you apply, or I can take your number and have someone call you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T10:32:34-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Please do. It's 401-555-0181. I'm usually home, except Tuesdays, when I volunteer covering the phones in my kid's school office."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T10:32:41-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0181. Since today's Wednesday, you're clear until next week anyway. Someone will call you back about the height rules and the fee."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T10:32:49-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. And the Hill, does that make it different? You said historic."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T10:32:53-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It can. I'll note that on the message so they address it when they call."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T10:32:58-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, I think I follow. Permit, maybe, who files, and what it costs. I'll hold off on signing until I hear from you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T10:33:06-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That sounds wise. Happy New Year, Ms. Tran."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T10:33:09-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, dear. You too."
    }
  ],
